{"type":"message","id":"7b057280","parentId":"83dac6b3","timestamp":"2026-03-22T05:46:37.485Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"已经发送了批量授权请求，用户应该会在飞书中收到一个新的授权卡片。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"已经重新发送授权请求了！📱\n\n请在飞书中查看授权卡片，点击完成授权。如果之前的二维码过期了，现在应该会有新的授权入口。\n\n授权完成后告诉我一声，我确认一下状态。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":66,"output":61,"cacheRead":33533,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":33660,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774158386489}}
